        <h1 class="article-title">OSRAM LED Lighting Review: Smarter Light for More Comfortable Homes</h1>

        <p class="article-intro">
          New designs, new possibilities, and a more intentional way to illuminate everyday life.
          Lighting is one of the most underestimated elements of interior design. A room may have
          beautiful furniture, carefully selected materials, and a restrained colour palette, yet
          still feel uncomfortable if the lighting is too harsh, too dim, or poorly positioned.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="article-cover">
